# Product Requirements Document (PRD)

## Title

**Universal UI Blocks Library (100 Core Blocks)**
*Easy → Advanced → Enterprise-grade, shadcn-angular compatible*

---

## 1. Purpose & Vision

Create a **canonical library of 100 UI blocks** that:

* Covers **90%+ of real-world websites & enterprise apps**
* Aligns with **shadcn / Radix philosophy** (headless, composable)
* Scales from **simple forms to enterprise platforms**
* Serves as the foundation of shadcn-angular

> These are blocks, not pages. Everything else is composition.

---

## 2. Design Principles

* **Composable, not monolithic**
* **Accessible by default**
* **Token-driven (contrast, motion, typography)**
* **Enterprise-safe** (audit-ready, predictable)
* **Progressive complexity** (easy → hard)

---

## 3. Block Categories

Blocks are grouped by **cognitive and technical complexity**:

1. Foundations (Easy)
2. Form Inputs (Easy–Medium)
3. Selection & Pickers (Medium)
4. Feedback & Overlays (Medium)
5. Data Display (Medium–Hard)
6. Navigation (Hard)
7. Layout & Containers (Hard)
8. Productivity & Workflow (Hard)
9. Enterprise & Platform Blocks (Very Hard)

---

